%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dataweave-formats-xml (言語ガイド)
doc と相違 (doc には出力があるが、実 DW はエラー)
doc の Output:
  {
      "test": true
  }
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
---
{
    test: payload.test is CDATA
}
%%% input payload application/xml
<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<test><![CDATA[A text <a>]]></test>
%%% error
Unable to resolve reference of: `CDATA`.
